@title Single-line diagram: the example with stated supply data, overload relay box, Enter supply data
@area Reports
# The bundled example states a 400 V supply with 10 kA, so the diagram shows figures and not question marks. The overload relay is a box on the motor feeder. The button opens the Electrical inputs.
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text single line
wait 4
key Enter
wait 20
shot example-single-line
check_blank example-single-line
check_layout
click_text "Enter supply data"
wait 6
expect "Electrical inputs"
shot example-single-line-supply-data
check_layout
